      `Zero-Tape Reversible Verlet Inverse (64 steps, O(1) memory):\nTarget ${targetHz.toFixed(1)} Hz -> Solved ${(Math.sqrt(k)*48000/(2*Math.PI)).toFixed(2)} Hz\nExact Zero-Tape Reversal Error: ${(Math.abs(qr-1)+Math.abs(pr)).toExponential(2)}`;
